    <string name="help_custom_result3">Kwa mfano, ukikiweka kichwa kama "Punguzo la 10%" na hesabu kama <xliff:g id="expression">[result - 10%]</xliff:g>, itaonyesha bei ikiwa imepunguzwa kwa 10%.</string>
